X:375
T:Vill ni ko:pa sill?
R:schottis
H:Schottis efter min far. I got this schottische from my father.
Z:There are words for the second part:
Z:Hejsan grabbar, vill ni ko:pa sill?
Z:Femton o:re valen eller vilket ni vill.
Z:Which means:
Z:Hello, lads, do you want to buy some herring?
Z:Fifteen pence a pound, or whatever you want to pay.
